## 5. Frozen Architecture Rules

These are non-negotiable. No sprint may override them without an SA-approved contract amendment.

| Rule | Governing Document |
|------|-------------------|
| system_entry is the sole execution gateway | EXECUTION_RUNTIME_GOVERNANCE_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Lifecycle authority is the runtime registry | LIFECYCLE_AND_PROJECTION_AUTHORITY_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Governance owns COMPLETE/RETRY/FAIL/BLOCK/ESCALATE | GOVERNANCE_CONTRACT_V3.txt |
| execution_result is execution truth | CONTROL_MODEL_V3.txt |
| Projection and frontend are non-authoritative | LIFECYCLE_AND_PROJECTION_AUTHORITY_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Mutation legality is enforced | MUTATION_LEGALITY_AND_RUNTIME_ISOLATION_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| AG1 / capability routing is advisory-only | AGENT_CAPABILITY_ROUTING_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Memory / learning is advisory-only unless separately approved | MEMORY_STORAGE_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Adaptive orchestration remains quarantined | ADAPTIVE_RUNTIME_ORCHESTRATION_CONTRACT_V2.txt |
| Reference systems are non-authoritative | DOCUMENT_INTERPRETATION_MODEL_V2.txt |

